    {
      "id": "claim_17336969115a4b90826859e4e681616a",
      "statement": "validateFileMetadata is the single size gate (maxSize, default 1 GB via DEFAULT_RECEIVE_OPTIONS); receiver-side validation failure sends EVENT_VALIDATE_ERROR back to the sender and records the error on the file, while autoAccept (default true) makes the receiver accept valid files without user action.",
