    {
      "id": "claim_b91ab451f2e647d0bdd2a420508107cb",
      "statement": "The data channel is created ordered:false, so chunk ordering is enforced by the protocol (one receiver ack drives one sender chunk, isolated per file id) rather than by channel-level ordering; completion is exact-declared-size based with no trailer or checksum.",
