      "statement": "Bulk download builds a real store-only ZIP archive in memory (createZipStoreOnly: method-0 entries, CRC-32, UTF-8 name flag, duplicate-name disambiguation, no new dependency) and saves a single zero-share-files.zip via triggerDownload, instead of the former sequential per-file raw downloads that never produced a zip.",
