      "id": "claim_5e3dea9d18014ed1852bf4f401a9204b",
      "statement": "All receiver downloads route through triggerDownload, which defers URL.revokeObjectURL ~1 second after clicking the temporary download anchor, because revoking in the same tick can abort the async download in some engines (e.g. Firefox starting the fetch after the revoke).",
